'X-ray structure of Drosophila dopamine transporter with subsiteB mutations (D121G/S426M) bound to beta-CFT or Win35428' 
_struct.pdbx_model_details           
;D.melanogaster DAT construct with mutations V74A, D121G, L415A, S426M, with N-terminal deletion 1-20, EL2 deletion between 164-206 and C-terminal thrombin insertion at residues 602-607.
Molecule crystallized in complexed with antibody fragment-9D5 using hanging-drop vapour diffusion method.
